EXPERIMENTAL, not applied by the PKGBUILD. Applies on top of patch 0001.

Polls the status query (40 ff 00) after opening the device until the sensor
reports ready (0x03), as the upstream elanmoc driver does. Meant to avoid the
firmware hang described in docs/protocol-notes.md. Verified without a finger
on the sensor only; never tested in the situation it is meant to fix.

License: LGPL-2.1-or-later, like libfprint.

